{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dear players, monsters do not spawn automatically. Use the \u2018C\u2019 key to switch to the overhead view and press the start button to spawn them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a single-player, third-person 3D tower defense game that blends shooting, racing, optical illusions, and traditional strategy gameplay. Build defense towers to fend off enemies or press \u2018C\u2019 to switch perspectives and join the battle directly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Press the \u2018C\u2019 key to freely switch between interfaces, then in overhead mode, press the start button to enjoy a thrilling experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use keypad 1, 2, 3 to quickly select defense towers, and W, A, S, D to move. Both the character perspective and overhead perspective allow movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516920/extras/English.jpg?t=1747393206\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3516920?t=1747393206","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516920/91866fe1ec805a138d0188b08734660f92353118/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747393206","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516920/b7a83d0cf5d12921a798d786dea83a2ce2944a1d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747393206","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516920/b7a83d0cf5d12921a798d786dea83a2ce2944a1d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747393206","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3619440,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dear players, monsters do not spawn automatically. Use the \u2018C\u2019 key to switch to th